Z||000008||Monkeyman||07-28-2001||06:18 AM||||Personally, I think the new style Cavs are coyote ugly and ergonomically futzed up.  That said, there's a guy that comes into my store most days that has a newer Z24 (at least that's what it says on his windshield) with tons of mods.  Must have a hellacious motor since it's beat every Fiero I've ever had.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  It's been lowered with some sort of body kit and a larger wing.  Oddly enough, it doesn't look ricey at all.  If I can catch him the next time he comes in the store, I'll try to get a run down of his mods and some pics if I can.<P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
